   452	/**Function*************************************************************
   453	
   454	  Synopsis    [Runs the stmap54 mapper probe.]
   455	
   456	  Description [stmap54 measures direct SCL load/max-cap pressure after an
   457	  initial base-gain map, keeps the stmap49 high-pressure SCL/genlib gain, and
   458	  remaps with a cut-only one-sided severe-pressure exception in mapper mode 55.
   459	  The hypothesis is that candidates with bounded cut-side pressure, missing
   460	  reconstructed node pressure, and stronger arrival improvement can recover
   461	  area without treating missing pressure evidence as agreement.]
